  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -70,
        -36
      ],
      "id": 30,
      "text": "I2C1 of the Blue Pill (PB6 SCL, PB7 SDA, 400 kHz, 4.7 kOhm pull-ups to 3.3 V) with an SSD1306 OLED (0x3C),\na BMP280 (0x76, SDO on GND) and a DS3231 clock (0x68). Run (F5): the OLED shows the time, the date, the\ntemperature and the pressure every 0.5 s. Change the BMP280's pressure or temperature in Properties while running."
    }
